#
# ONE NARROW EXEMPTION, and it is not a relaxation of anything.
#
# The repository root ignores `*secret*` so a credential file can never be committed by accident.
# That rule is right, and it stays. But it also swallows SecretsView.tsx — a React component with no
# credential in it — so the file silently never appeared in `git status`, never appeared in a diff,
# and would have been missing from the first commit of a module that cannot build without it.
#
# Re-included by exact name only. A new `*secret*` file in this folder is still ignored, which is the
# behaviour the root rule exists for.
!SecretsView.tsx
